flowchart TD
    U[Listener request] --> P[Bounded preference parser]
    P -->|Valid preferences| R[Catalog retriever]
    P -->|Invalid or ambiguous| E[Safe error]
    C[(Local songs CSV)] --> R
    R --> A[Weighted ranking and optional diversity]
    A --> V[Runtime reliability evaluator]
    C --> V
    V -->|Pass| O[Grounded ranked songs and reasons]
    V -->|Fail once| F[Trusted ranker retry]
    F --> V2[Second evaluation]
    V2 -->|Pass| O
    V2 -->|Fail| E
    V --> L[Diagnostic logs]
    V2 --> L
    T[Automated regression and fault injection tests] -.-> P
    T -.-> V
    H[Human review of relevance and limitations] -.-> O
